Package: BSgenome.Ecoli.NCBI.ASM584v2
Title: Full genome sequences for Escherichia coli K-12 MG1655 (NCBI assembly ASM584v2)
Description: Full genome sequences for Escherichia coli K-12 MG1655 as
    provided by NCBI (assembly accession GCF_000005845.2 / ASM584v2,
    chromosome U00096.3, 4,641,652 bp). The sequences are stored in an
    on-disk format that is compatible with the BSgenome infrastructure,
    enabling efficient random-access retrieval of subsequences. This package
    is intended as a companion data resource for TmCalculator and related
    Bioconductor workflows requiring the E. coli K-12 MG1655 reference genome.
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Junhui Li [aut, cre]
